OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and isolated,
OL,6,Fmainly coastal showers to start. Cloud
OL,7,Fincreasing through the day, with a few
OL,8,Finland light showers possible in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Breezy to start, especially
OL,10,Fnear coasts, then winds falling light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny lingering showers soon
OL,13,Fclearing this evening. Becoming dry
OL,14,Fwith some clear spells. Light winds
OL,15,Fthroughout. Feeling chilly, especially
OL,16,Fin rural spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
