OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA dry but cloudy and breezy
OL,6,Fstart. Becoming increasingly windy as
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain spread eastward
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon, perhaps heavy
OL,9,Fat times in the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FSunny
OL,12,Fintervals and possible isolated
OL,13,Fshowers Friday. Dry start Saturday,
OL,14,Frain later. Mostly cloudy with
OL,15,Foccasional showers Sunday.
OL,16,FTemperatures trending a little above
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
